  "about": {
    "heading": "I'm Jess, and it took me a long time to find my voice. Now I've found it, I'm not going to let it go.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "I've worked with thousands of people around the world, from CEOs, founders and C-suite leaders to students, graduates, street children, refugees and asylum seekers. I care about voices from anywhere and everywhere.",
      "My background is in human rights, children's rights and international development. I'm also a self-identified empath and a Pisces, for those of you into star signs.",
      "I've learnt that voice is so much more than the things we say and how we say them. When we find our voice, nurture it and share it, the world changes, and our world changes too. We can connect with people, share stories, ideas and even solutions."
    ],
    "highlight": "I believe voice confidence is the great gift that unlocks our ability to achieve our goals and reach our dreams."
  },
